    <string name="tnc_content">
        <![CDATA[
        <font color="#004B71"><b>YOUR PRIVACY &amp; SECURITY IS OUR TOP PRIORITY.</b></font><br><br>

        <b>1. SINGLE DEVICE POLICY:</b><br>
        To maintain account security, one User ID is strictly limited to <b>ONE MOBILE DEVICE ONLY</b>. Accessing Nursing Studio on multiple devices (Mobiles, Tablets, or Laptops) simultaneously is prohibited.<br><br>

        <b>2. ANTI-PIRACY &amp; SECURITY:</b><br>
        Our content (Video Lectures, PDFs, and Test Series) is protected by high-end encryption. Any attempt to bypass security, including screen recording or screenshots, will trigger an <b>AUTOMATIC PERMANENT BAN</b>.<br><br>

        <b>3. ZERO TOLERANCE POLICY:</b><br>
        Any suspicious activity or attempt to tamper with the app will lead to an <b>IMMEDIATE ACCOUNT BAN</b> followed by strict <b>LEGAL ACTION</b> under the IT Act 2000.<br><br>

        <b>4. CONTENT RIGHTS:</b><br>
        All study materials are the intellectual property of Nursing Studio. Copying, editing, distributing, or selling our content is a criminal offense.<br><br>

        <b>5. LEGAL PROCEEDINGS:</b><br>
        Unauthorized sharing of content will lead to <b>CRIMINAL INVESTIGATION</b> and heavy financial penalties as per Indian Intellectual Property laws.<br><br>

        <b>6. REFUND POLICY:</b><br>
        Digital content access is non-refundable once purchased.
        ]]>
    </string>

        <string name="privacy_content">
        <![CDATA[
        <font color="#004B71"><b>YOUR PRIVACY IS OUR TOP PRIORITY.</b></font><br><br>

        <b>1. DATA ENCRYPTION:</b><br>
        Your personal details are encrypted and stored on world-class <b>GOOGLE FIREBASE</b> servers. Your trust is our biggest asset.<br><br>

        <b>2. ZERO DATA SHARING:</b><br>
        We do not sell or share your information with any third-party marketing agencies. Your data stays with us.<br><br>

        <b>3. DEVICE IDENTIFICATION:</b><br>
        We collect your unique <b>DEVICE ID</b> to enforce our Single Device Policy and prevent unauthorized access.<br><br>

        <b>4. STRICT MONITORING:</b><br>
        We monitor login patterns to ensure security. Any unauthorized login attempts will result in <b>PERMANENT TERMINATION</b> and <b>LEGAL PROCEEDINGS</b>.<br><br>

        <b>5. APP PERMISSIONS:</b><br>
        We require Storage access for PDF downloads and Camera for profile updates. No other private data is accessed.<br><br>

        <b>6. SECURITY AUDITS:</b><br>
        Regular security audits are performed to ensure your learning environment is safe and professional.
        ]]>
    </string>


    <string name="quiz_default_instructions">
        <![CDATA[
        <font color="#FF0000"><b><i>GENERAL INSTRUCTIONS</i></b></font><br><br>

        <font color="#D97706"><b>1. GENERAL PRACTICE DISCLAIMER</b></font><br>
        This test series is designed exclusively for self-assessment and educational practice. Attempting this test does not guarantee job placement or official recruitment selection.<br><br>

        <font color="#D97706"><b>2. NETWORK & ENVIRONMENT PREPARATION</b></font><br>
        This is an online examination. Please verify your mobile data or Wi-Fi stability before beginning. Switching networks during the test may interrupt synchronization.<br><br>

        <font color="#D97706"><b>3. MARKING SCHEME & QUALIFYING CUTOFF</b></font><br>
        • <b>Correct Answer:</b> +1.0 Mark<br>
        • <b>Incorrect Answer (Negative Marking):</b> -0.25 Marks (1/4th Penalty)<br>
        • <b>Unattempted Questions:</b> 0.0 Marks (No penalty)<br>
        • <b>Minimum Passing Criterion:</b> 40% overall score.<br><br>

        <font color="#D97706"><b>4. SECURITY & ANTI-CHEATING POLICY</b></font><br>
        Capturing screenshots, screen recording, copying questions, or utilizing unauthorized external help is strictly prohibited. Any suspicious activity will result in immediate test cancellation, account <b>PERMANENT DEBARMENT</b>, and legal action under applicable digital rights regulations.<br><br>

        <font color="#D97706"><b>5. TIMER & AUTO-SUBMISSION</b></font><br>
        A live countdown timer will be visible on the top navigation bar. When the time expires, your test will be <b>AUTOMATICALLY SUBMITTED</b> with all saved responses.<br><br>

        <font color="#D97706"><b>6. QUESTION PALETTE COLOR CODES</b></font><br>
        Navigate through the Question Grid using these status colors:<br>
        • <font color="#16A34A"><b>GREEN:</b></font> Answered Questions<br>
        • <font color="#DC2626"><b>RED:</b></font> Unanswered / Viewed Questions<br>
        • <font color="#7C3AED"><b>VIOLET:</b></font> Marked for Review<br>
        • <font color="#64748B"><b>GRAY:</b></font> Unvisited Questions<br><br>

        <font color="#D97706"><b>7. NAVIGATION & ANSWER SAVING RULES</b></font><br>
        • You can tap any question number on the grid to jump directly to it.<br>
        • Selecting an option and tapping <b>NEXT</b> locks and records your response.<br>
        • You may leave a question unanswered by simply skipping to another question.<br><br>

        <i>Wish you all the best for your examination!</i>
        ]]>
    </string>


